      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka wa kumi na tsano wa utawala wa Kaisari Tiberiyo, mfalume mkpwulu wa tsi zosi zotawalwa ni Arumi, Pontio Pilato kala anatawala jimbo ra Judea. Herode kala anatawala jimbo ra Galilaya, na nduguye Filipu kala anatawala majimbo ga Iturea na Tirakoniti, naye Lusania kala anatawala Abilene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anasi na Kayafa kala ni akulu a alavyadzi-sadaka. Wakati hinyo Johana mwana wa Zakariya kala a weruni na Mlungu achimlagiza aandze kazi ya kuhubiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, Johana waphiya seemu zosi zophakana na muho Joridani kuno anahubiri, kuamba, “Tubuni dambi mʼbatizwe ili Mlungu akuswameheni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.40.3+ISA.40.4+ISA.40.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isaya 40:3–5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kala anahubiri kama vyoandikpwa ni nabii Isaya kuamba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
